  "ruleText": "Lab 1501.01 Purpose. These rules establish standards for the operation, regulation, and licensing of employee leasing companies, as permitted by statute.\n\nSource. #6626, eff 11-4-97, EXPIRED: 11-4-05\n\nNew. #10221, eff 11-3-12, ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
